<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.43 points off FTSE, July 21.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.43 points off FTSE, July 21.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on July 21 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.43 points off the index in early trading.</p>
<p>						  DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>						  (PENCE)    EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY			  Net	 Net</p>
<p> * British Land		    6.08     0.164</p>
<p> * Dixons Group		    8.10     0.194</p>
<p> * Grand Metropolitan	    6.25     0.075</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
